    "sections": {
        "description": "The Creative Photography theme is built for photographers, artists, and visual storytellers who need a structured way to present visual work online. It provides a clean and responsive layout that adjusts across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices for consistent viewing. The theme includes built-in options for creating a photography website with organized sections for images and content. Users can manage a photography portfolio using customizable layouts that support high-resolution images and flexible display settings. It also offers a photo gallery feature for arranging and showcasing collections in a clear format. Basic customization tools such as layout variations and drag-and-drop page building are included to simplify design changes. Social media integration allows content sharing across platforms, and the theme supports use cases such as personal sites or profiles on a freelance marketplace. Additional features include an SEO-friendly structure, optimized performance, and compatibility with high-traffic environments, making it suitable for presenting fine art, commercial, or lifestyle photography in a straightforward manner."
    },
